# Keep the working tree LF on every platform.
#
# Without this, core.autocrlf=true checks source out with CRLF on Windows, and
# `gofmt -l ./cmd ./internal` then flags every Go file purely on line endings —
# the same check ci.yml gates on, so local and CI results disagree for anyone
# on Windows. Blobs are already stored LF; this only fixes the checkout.
* text=auto eol=lf

# Binary and pre-encoded assets must never be touched.
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.gif binary
*.ico binary
*.woff binary
*.woff2 binary
*.exe binary
*.db binary
